descriptions.description:
These grib2 files contain ensemble forecast data including hourly accumulated precipitation, hourly composite reflectivity, and hourly maximum 2-5km updraft helicity from Ensemble Kalman Filter data assimilation. &lt;br&gt;
These datasets were prepared for submission of GRL manuscript. &lt;br&gt;

Forecast Model: FV3-LAM of SRWAPP version 2 &lt;br&gt;
DA Infrastructure: GSI EnSRF, JEDI LETKF and LGETKF &lt;br&gt;
20190521 00UTC + 3 hr &lt;br&gt;
Each ensemble consists of 40 members &lt;br&gt;

&lt;br&gt;
${EXP}.${MEMBER}.f${FCSTHR}.grib2 &lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
EXP: Experiment &lt;br&gt;
- NODA : forecasts without data assimilation &lt;br&gt;
- GSIEnSRF: forecasts from data assimilation analyses using Ensemble Square-Root Kalman Filter (EnSRF) from Gridpoint Statistical Interpolation (GSI) &lt;br&gt;
- JEDILETKF: forecasts from data assimilation analyses using Local Ensemble Transform Kalman Filter (LETKF) from The Joint Effort for Data Assimilation Integration (JEDI) &lt;br&gt;
- JEDILGETKF0.6: forecasts from data assimilation analyses using the gain form of LETKF from JEDI (60 % for retained fraction of variance for model-space vertical localization) &lt;br&gt;
- JEDILGETKF0.99: forecasts from data assimilation analyses using the gain form of LETKF from JEDI (99 % for retained fraction of variance) &lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
MEMBER: ensemble member (1-40) &lt;br&gt;
FCSTHR: foreast hour (1-3) &lt;br&gt;
